### Read the session — GET /api/v1/session
# Answers who the browser is signed in as. Run it once, unauthenticated, to obtain the XSRF-TOKEN cookie every
# write needs; a read itself needs no CSRF token. What it answers and refuses:
# ../../contracts/in/web-session-api.md

@host = http://localhost:1000
# Set from the fb_session cookie sign-in.http sets.
@sessionCookie = paste-the-fb_session-cookie-value-here

### Who am I.
GET {{host}}/api/v1/session
Cookie: fb_session={{sessionCookie}}
